39
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,200
Voilà, le café.
There you go, the coffee.

40
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:02,900
Merci.
Thank you.

41
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,140
Parce que ça va cavaler dans ce film.
Because it's going to be hectic on this film.

42
