Il est joyeux.
It's a happy word.

52
00:01:21,030 --> 00:01:21,950
Il veut être comédien.
He wants to be an actor.

53
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:22,690
Il galère, le pauvre.
Poor guy's struggling.

54
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:24,270
Comme la moitié des serveurs à Paris.
Like half the waiters in Paris.

55
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,990
Mais en même temps, tu vois, dans ce scénario-là, je me dis qu'il y a peut-être un rôle pour
But at the same time, you know, in this screenplay, I'm thinking there might be a role for

56
00:01:28,990 --> 00:01:29,150
lui.
him.

57
00:01:29,290 --> 00:01:30,830
Tu sais, celui de Bassim, le garde du corps.
You know, that Bassim character, the bodyguard.

58
00:01:30,930 --> 00:01:32,090
Il a trois répliques, un peu de figure.
He's got three lines, a bit of screen time.

59
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:33,410
Ça pourrait le faire, ça.
That could work for him.

60
00:01:33,850 --> 00:01:36,930
Tu ne peux pas demander au directeur de casting de faire un essai avec lui ?
Can't you ask the casting director to do a screen test with him?

61
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:37,530
Demain pas.
Not tomorrow.

62
00:01:37,730 --> 00:01:38,010
Si.
Yes.

63
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:38,770
Si, bien sûr.
Yes, of course.

64
00:01:39,410 --> 00:01:39,750
Lui, lui.
Him, him.

65
00:01:41,610 --> 00:01:42,030
Samy !
Samy!

66
00:01:42,610 --> 00:01:43,010
Viens voir.
Come here.

67
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:43,990
Yes.
Yes.

68
00:01:44,890 --> 00:01:46,450
Ça t'intéresse toujours, le cinéma ?
You still into cinema?

69
00:01:46,450 --> 00:01:47,010
Ah non, mais grave.
Oh no, absolutely.

70
00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:47,370
Oui.
Yeah.

71
