78
00:01:52,570 --> 00:01:53,070
Oui, j'ai tout ça.
Yes, I've got all that.

79
00:01:53,210 --> 00:01:53,950
Par contre, c'est dans mon sac.
It's in my bag, though.

80
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:54,470
Je vous le ramène tout de suite.
I'll go get it right now.

81
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:56,010
Oh là là là là là.
Oh my goodness.

82
00:01:56,670 --> 00:01:57,070
Mais lâche.
Let go.

83
00:01:57,110 --> 00:01:58,530
Mais c'est un rêve, là, que vous êtes en train de réaliser.
This is literally a dream coming true for you right now.

84
00:01:58,550 --> 00:01:58,770
Attends, attends.
Hold on, hold on.

85
00:01:58,870 --> 00:01:59,430
C'est des essais.
These are screen tests.

86
