Si tu les rates, on ne peut plus rien pour toi.
If you blow them, we can't do anything more for you.

87
00:02:00,970 --> 00:02:01,610
Ah non, mais il n'y a pas de problème.
No, no, that's not a problem at all.

88
00:02:01,670 --> 00:02:02,330
On les fait quand, les essais ?
When do we do the tests?

89
00:02:02,330 --> 00:02:02,990
On peut même les faire tout de suite.
We could even do them right now.

90
00:02:02,990 --> 00:02:04,210
Tu sais quoi ? Il y a une scène à faire, là.
You know what? There's a scene we can do right here.

91
00:02:04,210 --> 00:02:04,630
Il y a une scène à jouer.
There's a scene to play.

92
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:05,470
Je te braque si tu veux.
I'll hold you up if you want.

93
00:02:05,550 --> 00:02:06,310
Je te fais tout ce que tu veux.
I'll do whatever you want.

94
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:07,270
Non, mais sérieux, sérieux, sérieux.
No, but seriously, seriously, seriously.

95
00:02:07,470 --> 00:02:07,670
OK.
OK.

96
00:02:07,910 --> 00:02:08,670
On va mettre de la musique.
We'll put some music on.

97
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:09,230
On va faire la teuf.
We'll get the party going.

98
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:10,710
Ce n'est plus un bar, c'est une discothèque aujourd'hui.
This isn't a bar anymore — it's a club tonight.

99
00:02:10,750 --> 00:02:11,450
D'accord ? OK ?
Alright? OK?

100
