00:49:02,800 --> 00:49:03,240
Ça contracte.
It's contracting.

1316
00:49:04,030 --> 00:49:05,410
Disons que ça s'est intensifié un peu, là, ouais.
Let's just say it's intensified a bit, yeah.

1317
00:49:06,420 --> 00:49:08,120
T'es sûre que c'est pas ton utérus tonique ?
Are you sure it's not your hypertonic uterus?

1318
00:49:08,120 --> 00:49:08,940
Mais j'en sais rien, hein.
I really don't know.

1319
00:49:08,940 --> 00:49:10,560
C'est pas beaucoup d'expérience, si tu veux.
I don't have much experience with this, you know.

1320
00:49:11,480 --> 00:49:12,040
Ah, non.
No.

1321
00:49:12,200 --> 00:49:13,720
Mais je pense que ça va passer.
But I think it'll pass.

1322
00:49:14,260 --> 00:49:14,900
Je pense que c'est...
I think it's...

1323
00:49:14,900 --> 00:49:15,260
Ah !
Ah!

1324
00:49:15,260 --> 00:49:23,780
Elle dit quoi, la sage-femme, là ?
What's the midwife saying?

1325
00:49:23,780 --> 00:49:25,660
Non, non, on est dans des bureaux, là.
No, no, we're in an office building here.

1326
00:49:25,740 --> 00:49:27,020
On peut pas lui faire prendre un bain.
We can't give her a bath.

1327
00:49:27,640 --> 00:49:31,130
C'est la mère qui crie comme ça ?
Is that the mother screaming like that?

1328
00:49:31,130 --> 00:49:32,830
Oui, c'est la mère qui crie comme ça, là.
Yes, that's the mother screaming like that.

1329
00:49:32,970 --> 00:49:34,330
Oh, bah, elle va accoucher, là.
Oh, well, she's about to give birth.

1330
00:49:34,430 --> 00:49:35,050
Bah, non, mais là, le...
Well, no, but the...

1331
00:49:35,050 --> 00:49:36,590
Je sais pas, le SAMU va pas tarder.
I don't know, the paramedics won't be long.

1332
00:49:36,810 --> 00:49:37,890
Ah, non, on attend pas.
No, we're not waiting.

1333
00:49:37,910 --> 00:49:39,230
Elle est en train de pousser, là, madame.
She's pushing right now, ma'am.

1334
00:49:39,430 --> 00:49:40,450
Le bébé va sortir.
The baby's coming out.

1335
00:49:40,530 --> 00:49:41,810
Il faut quelqu'un pour l'accueillir, là.
Someone needs to catch it.

1336
00:49:41,830 --> 00:49:42,370
Je vais vous guider.
I'll guide you through it.

1337
00:49:42,370 --> 00:49:43,570
Non, non, non, non, mais...
No, no, no, no, but...

1338
00:49:43,570 --> 00:49:44,630
Enfin, non, non, moi, je...
I mean, no, no, me, I...

1339
00:49:44,630 --> 00:49:45,070
On attend pas.
We're not waiting.

1340
00:49:45,130 --> 00:49:46,070
Vous allez le faire maintenant.
You're doing it right now.

1341
00:49:46,770 --> 00:49:47,290
D'accord.
Okay.

1342
00:49:47,930 --> 00:49:48,490
D'accord.
Okay.

1343
00:49:48,890 --> 00:49:49,390
Ah !
Ah!

1344
00:49:49,390 --> 00:49:50,270
Je vous écoute.
I'm listening.

1345
00:49:50,350 --> 00:49:50,550
Ah !
Ah!

1346
00:49:50,960 --> 00:49:51,700
C'est parti.
Here we go.

1347
00:49:52,300 --> 00:49:53,300
C'est qui, mon ange ?
Who is it, my angel?

1348
00:49:53,300 --> 00:49:54,080
C'est toi, Isabelle Adjani.
It's you, Isabelle Adjani.

1349
00:49:55,420 --> 00:49:55,780
OK.
OK.

1350
00:49:56,380 --> 00:49:58,760
Mathias, j'ai besoin de vos lacets pour clamper le cordon.
Mathias, I need your shoelaces to clamp the cord.

1351
00:49:58,940 --> 00:49:59,680
Pardon ?
Excuse me?

1352
00:50:00,360 --> 00:50:01,200
On discute pas.
No discussion.

1353
00:50:01,220 --> 00:50:01,700
Fais ce que je dis.
Do what I say.

1354
00:50:01,780 --> 00:50:02,980
Allez, c'est parti.
Come on, let's go.

1355
00:50:05,430 --> 00:50:05,970
J'arrive.
I'm coming.

1356
00:50:06,270 --> 00:50:09,660
On m'installe.
Get me set up.

1357
00:50:10,120 --> 00:50:10,480
Voilà.
There we go.

1358
00:50:11,160 --> 00:50:11,880
Aïe, je suis.
Ow, I'm right here.

1359
00:50:12,280 --> 00:50:13,380
Qu'est-ce que vous voyez ?
What do you see?

1360
00:50:13,380 --> 00:50:13,940
Alors...
So...

1361
00:50:14,360 --> 00:50:15,300
Euh, j'ai quoi ?
Um, what do I have?

1362
00:50:15,300 --> 00:50:16,620
Une boule ?
A lump?

1363
00:50:17,260 --> 00:50:17,920
C'est là.
Right there.

1364
00:50:17,940 --> 00:50:20,400
C'est la tête.
That's the head.

1365
00:50:20,640 --> 00:50:23,460
À la prochaine contraction, le bébé va sortir les épaules.
At the next contraction, the baby's going to bring the shoulders out.

1366
00:50:23,720 --> 00:50:24,900
Ça se passe très bien.
It's going very well.

1367
00:50:25,120 --> 00:50:26,560
Vous vous débrouillez comme un chef.
You're doing a fantastic job.

1368
00:50:28,240 --> 00:50:32,480
Non, ce n'est pas la mort.
No, it's not the end of the world.

1369
00:50:42,040 --> 00:50:42,440
Agnez-le.
Hold onto it.

1370
00:50:42,680 --> 00:50:44,120
Vous allez voir, il va sortir tout seul.
You'll see, it'll come out on its own.

1371
00:50:44,560 --> 00:50:46,680
Non, mais ça glisse comme un poisson.
No, but it's slipping like a fish.

1372
00:50:51,590 --> 00:50:52,710
Directement sur le ventre de la mer.
Straight onto the mother's stomach.

1373
00:50:53,090 --> 00:52:36,720
On peut reprendre des forces.
We can get our strength back.

1374
00:52:37,020 --> 00:52:38,060
Tu peux en faire des gélules.
You could put it in capsules.

1375
00:52:38,140 --> 00:52:39,200
La Gwyneth Paltrow, elle le fait.
Gwyneth Paltrow does it.

1376
00:52:40,900 --> 00:52:41,980
Non, ça ira.
No, I'm fine.

1377
00:52:42,020 --> 00:52:42,620
Merci, Noémie.
Thank you, Noémie.

1378
00:52:43,080 --> 00:53:16,540
Oh bah, merci de m'avoir accompagnée.
Oh well, thank you for being here with me.

1379
00:53:16,920 --> 00:53:19,460
Je suis épuisée.
I'm exhausted.

1380
00:53:19,500 --> 00:53:20,300
Je vais m'écrouler, je crois.
I think I'm going to collapse.

1381
00:53:21,760 --> 00:53:22,160
Excusez-moi.
Excuse me.

1382
00:53:22,160 --> 00:53:24,000
La Gwyneth, aujourd'hui, c'est très, très fort.
Gwyneth today was very, very impressive.

1383
00:53:25,080 --> 00:53:26,020
C'est exceptionnel.
She was exceptional.

1384
00:53:27,370 --> 00:53:29,070
Oh non, c'est Andrea qui est exceptionnelle.
Oh no, it's Andrea who's exceptional.

1385
00:53:29,270 --> 00:53:30,230
C'est elle qui a tout fait.
She did everything.

1386
00:53:34,620 --> 00:53:35,800
Bon bah, bonne nuit, Mathias.
Well, good night, Mathias.

1387
00:54:05,180 --> 00:54:06,540
Qu'est-ce que tu fais ?
What are you doing?

1388
00:54:06,540 --> 00:54:08,360
Ben, tu vois, je nettoie.
Well, you can see, I'm cleaning up.

1389
00:54:11,150 --> 00:54:12,270
Ben, ce n'est pas à toi de faire ça.
That's not for you to do.

1390
00:54:12,990 --> 00:54:13,770
Si, c'est à moi.
Yes, it is.

1391
00:54:14,250 --> 00:54:17,250
C'est à moi.
It's my job.

1392
00:54:17,470 --> 00:54:17,750
Sous-titrage MFP.
Subtitling MFP.
